  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement legal advice - Legal advice required</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">External legal services in relation to the GEEAP procurement. The Global Education Experts Advisory Panel (GEEAP) and Building Evidence in Education (BE2) is a strategic partner on the What Works Hub for Global Education.  The legal advice is necessary to enable the programme to continue with the procurement process and enable the programme to deliver on the secretariat role which is to deliver on the strategic and operational support for the global networks on education research: the Global Education Experts Advisory Panel (GEEAP) and Building Evidence in Education (BE2).</narrative>
  </description>
